  "title": "I’m Taking a Taxi",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2023-09-07",
  "synopsis": "Amy is going to the hotel! How should she communicate with the taxi driver?\r\nIn this lesson, we will focus on learning about how to take a taxi and make requests to the driver.",
