    "title": "Amy’s Trip to Beijing",
    "chapter": 4,
    "totalChapters": 29
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "我坐出租车\n\n司机：您好！您要去哪儿？\n爱米：你好！我要去北京大饭店，谢谢！\n司机：好的。行李我帮您放车后面。\n爱米：好的，谢谢！从机场到北京大饭店，要多少分钟？\n司机：三十分钟吧。\n爱米：不好意思，我有点儿晕车，请问能开窗吗？\n司机：好的。现在好点儿了吗？\n爱米：好多了，谢谢！但是，有点儿冷。\n司机：我关窗，开空调吧。\n爱米：好的，谢谢！请问，我们快到了吗？\n司机：快到了，还有五分钟。这个时间是下班时间，车很多，您再等等。\n爱米：好的。\n司机：到了。一百二十块，谢谢！\n爱米：给你，谢谢！",
    "traditional": "我坐出租車\n\n司機：您好！您要去哪兒？\n愛米：你好！我要去北京大飯店，謝謝！\n司機：好的。行李我幫您放車後面。\n愛米：好的，謝謝！從機場到北京大飯店，要多少分鐘？\n司機：三十分鐘吧。\n愛米：不好意思，我有點兒暈車，請問能開窗嗎？\n司機：好的。現在好點兒了嗎？\n愛米：好多了，謝謝！但是，有點兒冷。\n司機：我關窗，開空調吧。\n愛米：好的，謝謝！請問，我們快到了嗎？\n司機：快到了，還有五分鐘。這個時間是下班時間，車很多，您再等等。\n愛米：好的。\n司機：到了。一百二十塊，謝謝！\n愛米：給你，謝謝！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I’m Taking a Taxi"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "司机：您好！您要去哪儿？",
      "traditional": "司機：您好！您要去哪兒？",
      "pinyin": "sī jī nín hǎo nín yào qù nǎ'r",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Driver: Hello! Where are you going?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "爱米：你好！我要去北京大饭店，谢谢！",
      "traditional": "愛米：你好！我要去北京大飯店，謝謝！",
      "pinyin": "ài mǐ nǐ hǎo wǒ yào qù běi jīng dà fàn diàn xiè xie",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Amy: Hello! I’m going to the Beijing Hotel. Thank you!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "司机：好的。行李我帮您放车后面。",
      "traditional": "司機：好的。行李我幫您放車後面。",
      "pinyin": "sī jī hǎo de xíng li wǒ bāng nín fàng chē hòu miàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Driver: Okay. I’ll help you put your luggage in the back of the car."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "爱米：好的，谢谢！从机场到北京大饭店，要多少分钟？",
      "traditional": "愛米：好的，謝謝！從機場到北京大飯店，要多少分鐘？",
      "pinyin": "ài mǐ hǎo de xiè xie cóng jī chǎng dào běi jīng dà fàn diàn yào duō shao fēn zhōng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Amy: Okay, thank you! How many minutes does it take to get from the airport to the Beijing Hotel?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "司机：三十分钟吧。",
      "traditional": "司機：三十分鐘吧。",
      "pinyin": "sī jī sān shí fēn zhōng ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Driver: Maybe 30 minutes."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "爱米：不好意思，我有点儿晕车，请问能开窗吗？",
      "traditional": "愛米：不好意思，我有點兒暈車，請問能開窗嗎？",
      "pinyin": "ài mǐ bù hǎo yì si wǒ yǒu diǎn'r yùn chē qǐng wèn néng kāi chuāng ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Amy: Sorry, I’m a bit carsick. Can you open the window, please?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "司机：好的。现在好点儿了吗？",
      "traditional": "司機：好的。現在好點兒了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "sī jī hǎo de xiàn zài hǎo diǎn'r le ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Driver: Okay. Is it better now?"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "爱米：好多了，谢谢！但是，有点儿冷。",
      "traditional": "愛米：好多了，謝謝！但是，有點兒冷。",
      "pinyin": "ài mǐ hǎo duō le xiè xie dàn shì yǒu diǎn'r lěng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Amy: Much better, thank you! But it’s a little cold."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "司机：我关窗，开空调吧。",
      "traditional": "司機：我關窗，開空調吧。",
      "pinyin": "sī jī wǒ guān chuāng kāi kōng tiáo ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Driver: I’ll close the window and turn on the air conditioning."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "爱米：好的，谢谢！请问，我们快到了吗？",
      "traditional": "愛米：好的，謝謝！請問，我們快到了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "ài mǐ hǎo de xiè xie qǐng wèn wǒ men kuài dào le ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Amy: Okay, thank you! Excuse me, are we almost there?"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "司机：快到了，还有五分钟。",
      "traditional": "司機：快到了，還有五分鐘。",
      "pinyin": "sī jī kuài dào le hái yǒu wǔ fēn zhōng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "simplified": "这个时间是下班时间，车很多，您再等等。",
      "traditional": "這個時間是下班時間，車很多，您再等等。",
      "pinyin": "zhè ge shí jiān shì xià bān shí jiān chē hěn duō nín zài děng děng",
      "english": "Driver: Almost there, five more minutes."
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "This time is when people are getting off work. There are a lot of cars, so just wait a but more."
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "simplified": "爱米：好的。",
      "traditional": "愛米：好的。",
      "pinyin": "ài mǐ hǎo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Amy: Okay."
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "simplified": "司机：到了。一百二十块，谢谢！",
      "traditional": "司機：到了。一百二十塊，謝謝！",
      "pinyin": "sī jī dào le yì bǎi èr shí kuài xiè xie",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
